## Icons and desktop integration

Application control glyphs are resolved from the desktop's icon theme at
runtime; no icon font is bundled by the application. The Fan Fold application
icons (`src/fanfold/packaging/io.github.preyevates.FanFold.svg` and
`io.github.preyevates.FanFold-symbolic.svg`) are original to this project.

## System dependencies

Qt 6 (including QtWebEngine/Chromium) and KDE Frameworks are linked as system
libraries under their own licenses; they are not bundled in this repository.
